            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system information transmission method, a terminal and a network device are provided. The method includes: sending request information to a network device in the case that target Other SI is to be requested; receiving a random access message two or a random access message four which is sent by the network device based on the request information and carries preset indication information; and determining whether to receive subsequent broadcast information based on the random access message two or the random access message four.</p>
